2026-10-01 22:19:17 [deepseek-flash] First checks:
2026-10-01 22:19:17 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-01 22:19:17 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-01 22:19:17 [deepseek-flash] type -a ls
2026-10-01 22:19:17 [deepseek-flash] command ls -la; echo "exit=$?"
2026-10-01 22:19:17 [deepseek-flash] /bin/ls -la; echo "exit=$?"
2026-10-01 22:19:17 [deepseek-flash] env -i /bin/ls -la; echo "exit=$?"
