2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash] To reinstall cleanly with NVIDIA CUDA support on Arch:
2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash] 1. Make sure the NVIDIA driver and CUDA are working:
