2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash] 2. Create and activate a fresh venv:
2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash]    python -m venv ~/yolo-env
2026-10-01 22:23:32 [deepseek-flash]    source ~/yolo-env/bin/activate
