2026-10-01 22:28:54 [deepseek-flash] Common patterns that silently fall back to CPU:
2026-10-01 22:28:54 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-01 22:28:54 [deepseek-flash] - Ultralytics default is `device=None`, which auto-selects — usually GPU if available. But if torch
2026-10-01 22:28:54 [deepseek-flash] is CPU-only, it silently uses CPU.
