2026-10-01 22:35:48 [deepseek-flash] `.txt` whose lines aren’t real image paths, or a path that no longer exists but no longer raises
2026-10-01 22:35:48 [deepseek-flash] `FileNotFoundError` (e.g. an empty dir).
