2026-10-14 09:13:39 [gemini-4-argon] `"reasoning"` and echoes each item in `chunk.summary` prefixed with `[REASON]`.
2026-10-14 09:13:39 [gemini-4-argon]    * Google Generative AI (`connectGoogle`) & Anthropic (`connectAnthropic`): Currently,
2026-10-14 09:13:39 [gemini-4-argon] the custom completion wrappers for Gemini and Anthropic do not extract or map thought/reasoning
2026-10-14 09:13:39 [gemini-4-argon] parts into `choice.message.reasoning_content` (though `connectGoogle` does account for
2026-10-14 09:13:39 [gemini-4-argon] `usage.thoughtsTokenCount` in `completion_tokens`). If you are testing `reasonoutloud` with Gemini
2026-10-14 09:13:39 [gemini-4-argon] models that return thought parts via the SDK, they may be merged into `result.response.text()` or
2026-10-14 09:13:39 [gemini-4-argon] omitted unless explicitly extracted from `candidate.content.parts`.
