2026-10-16 14:44:42 [gemini-4-argon] command in the terminal window. You must place a dollar sign (`$`) immediately before the variable
2026-10-16 14:44:42 [gemini-4-argon] name so the shell knows to evaluate it rather than treat it as plain text.
2026-10-16 14:44:42 [gemini-4-argon] 
