2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] caveat: echoing reasoning into the visible channel can change model behaviour (models behave
2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] differently when they know their reasoning is displayed), and it consumes output tokens. Better for
2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] diagnosis than as a permanent setting.
