2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] models that support a native thinking channel will behave differently with it on. This is another
2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] source of "same model, different behaviour" variance that can confound your logs — worth logging
2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] its state per request.
