2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] failure mode: if un-squashed, models that see prior assistant turns can inherit earlier
2026-10-23 19:48:31 [glm-5.3] hallucinations as established context. Squashing gives each turn a clean slate — which is precisely
